---
title: Hamburger Casserole
author: Barbara Muirhead
category: Casseroles
cook time: 45 minutes
source: Loving Memories of Mildred
---

@hamburger{1%lb}
@onion
@salt
@pepper
@narrow noodles{1%16-oz package}
@mushroom soup{1%can}
@evaporated milk{1%small can}
@Velveeta cheese, cut up{0.5%lb}
@sliced stuffed olives{0.5%cup}
@Chow Mien Noodles

Brown hamburger with onion, salt and pepper. Cook a 16-oz package of narrow noodles and mix with hamburger, mushroom soup, evaporated milk, Velveeta cheese, and sliced stuffed olives. Bake at 350 degrees for 45 minutes. About 5 minutes before serving, sprinkle with Chow Mien Noodles.
